  "titleEn": "Principle of Explosion",
  "titleEs": "Principio de explosión",
  "titleText": {
    "es": "¿Quiere que lleve cucuruchos de galleta? Ah, claro, para el vino. Un segundo, déjeme derivar el número de tarjeta de crédito de su hijo y me pondré en camino.",
    "en": "You want me to pick up waffle cones? Oh, right, for the wine. One sec, let me just derive your son's credit card number and I'll be on my way.",
    "noteEn": "The Spanish archive and official xkcd source both identify comic #704, published 2010-02-19; their title texts are preserved exactly. The Spanish archive credits Gabriel Rodríguez Alberich as translator. The authored transcript follows the visible Spanish raster: it joins the printed line wraps CON-/TRADICTORIOS, OB-/TENER, and EXPLO-/SIÓN; restores ESTE ES SU NÚMERO and DE where OCR omitted them; preserves the logical formula P∧¬P as one excluded unit; and corrects missing written accents in RAZÓN, EMPECÉ, TELÉFONO, ASÍ, CÓMO, SÍ, MAMÁ, and CARTÓN. OCR's OJ and standalone dash are drawing and speech-tail strokes, not printed textual units."
  },
